\" /><\/a><a onclick=\"var popupWin = parent.window.open(this.href, null, 'resizable=1,status=1,scrollbars=1,width=800,height=600,top=0'); popupWin.focus(); event.preventDefault?event.preventDefault():event.returnValue = false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ReadAllReviews_69dd5d3e4b369f642360c5539fb90b06c6ecbe0b02a3a963b98f42b7148b92b2f7c04beda84ed7e83d0f525d512772da\" data-bvtrack=\"eName:ProfileLink\" href=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/profiles/1336/69dd5d3e4b369f642360c5539fb90b06c6ecbe0b02a3a963b98f42b7148b92b2f7c04beda84ed7e83d0f525d512772da/profile.htm\"><\/a><\/div><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVDI_BA BVDI_BAReview\"><div class=\"BVDIInside BVDI_BAInside\"><div class=\"BVDIBody BVDI_BABody\"><ul class=\"BVDI_BAList\"><li class=\"BVDI_BAItem BVDI_BAItemOdd BVDI_BAItemVerifiedPurchaser\"><div id=\"BVDI_BAPopup_26f4439zcnz4lg2s8vlpykdkz_ID\" class=\"BVDIPopup BVDI_BAPopup BVDI_BAPopupVerifiedPurchaser\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"BVDIInside BVDI_BAInsidePopup\"><div class=\"BVDIBody BVDI_BAPopupBody\"><dl class=\"BVDI_BAList\"><dt class=\"BVDI_BAItem BVDI_BAItemOnly BVDI_BAItemVerifiedPurchaser\">\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">Verified Purchaser<\/span><\/a><\/dt><dd><p>Customer has been confirmed to have purchased the item from Walmart.<\/p><\/dd><\/dl><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\" id=\"BVDI_BABadge_3fv6a9cvx3eu29pfatpv9z4rb_ID\"onmouseover=\"bvTooltip.show(&quot;BVDI_BAPopup_26f4439zcnz4lg2s8vlpykdkz_ID&quot;, this.id, false, []);\"onmouseout=\"bvTooltip.hide();\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">Verified Purchaser<\/span><\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n <div class=\"BVRRCustomUserInfoContainer\">\n<div class=\"BVRRContextDataContainer\"><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Main\">\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerTop\"><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewRatingsContainer\"> <div class=\"BVRROverallRatingContainer\" >\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingContainerStar\"><div class=\"BVRRRatingEntry BVRROdd\"><div id=\"BVRRRatingOverall_Review_Display\" class=\"BVRRRating BVRRRatingNormal BVRRRatingOverall\"><div class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRatingNormalLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRRatingNormalImage\">\n<div class=\"BVImgOrSprite\" style=\"width:75px;height:15px;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/1336/5_0/9/rating.png\" alt=\"4 out of 5\" title=\"4 out of 5\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" style=\"margin-left:-15px\" />\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\" class=\"BVRRRatingNormalOutOf\"> <span itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingNumber\">4<\/span>\n <span class=\"BVRRSeparatorText\">out of<\/span>\n <span itemprop=\"bestRating\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingRangeNumber\">5<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewTitleContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitlePrefix\"><\/span><span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewTitle\">Surprised<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitleSuffix\">, <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">08/23/2025<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2025-08-23\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText396218862_i35lofchpo9pvih1lqweub2aw_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\">I was really surprised at how well this works. I needed something quick and cheap. Didn\u2019t think it was going to be that good, but it was available at a great price. I have actually used this on several jobs now and it\u2019s done what I need it to do very<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkPrefix\">...<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText396218862_i35lofchpo9pvih1lqweub2aw_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview396218862_pufl77mcouvkfyxeqr6niywth_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(read full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div id=\"BVRRReview396218862_pufl77mcouvkfyxeqr6niywth_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText BVDIHidden\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">I was really surprised at how well this works. I needed something quick and cheap. Didn\u2019t think it was going to be that good, but it was available at a great price. I have actually used this on several jobs now and it\u2019s done what I need it to do very well. I\u2019ll keep on going with this until it decides to stop. It\u2019s been a very good surprise. Only complaint so far is that it drinks fuel like it\u2019s free beer at an open bar.<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText396218862_i35lofchpo9pvih1lqweub2aw_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview396218862_pufl77mcouvkfyxeqr6niywth_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_Trac